    "how_to_use_U6cean": {
      "type": "how-to-use",
      "blocks": {
        "tab_8DYLCh": {
          "type": "Tab",
          "settings": {
            "tab_txt": "Prepare",
            "tab_desc": "<p>Twist open the chamber of the device and fill with one ampule of serum.  Twist on needle head with lid to close it tight.<br/>Leave the device upside down for 1-2 minutes.  During this time, wash your face and make sure your hands are clean.</p>",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/6_ea9ed242-a7b5-4cdc-941b-ad54c7da2260.png"
          }
        },
        "tab_UzUCKk": {
          "type": "Tab",
          "settings": {
            "tab_txt": "Treatment",
            "tab_desc": "<p>Once the serum has had enough time to make its way into the needles, you can take off the lid and start micro-infusing!<br/>Start at the centre of the face and work your way outward to cover the full face. Perform 2/3 passes. Take any leftover serum from the device and pat it onto your face and neck to leave on overnight.</p>",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/1a_3.png"
          }
        },
        "tab_kkmNwF": {
          "type": "Tab",
          "settings": {
            "tab_txt": "Aftercare",
            "tab_desc": "<p>Once treatment is completed, place lid back on the needle head. Twist the lid off and dispose safely.<br/>Open a new sterile needle head and put it on the device ready for your next treatment.</p>",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/1a_4tt.png"
          }
        },
        "wistia_9NFNhM": {
          "type": "wistia",
          "settings": {
            "wistia_id": "8ymvdqzx92"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "tab_8DYLCh",
        "tab_UzUCKk",
        "tab_kkmNwF",
        "wistia_9NFNhM"
      ],
      "settings": {
