            "list": "<ul><li>Stamping doesn’t <strong>over-damage</strong> skin</li><li><strong>Little to no downtime</strong> & quick recovery of the skin</li><li>New needle heads provide sharp, straight needles for every treatment - designed for better efficacy</li><li>Disposable heads minimizes risk of infection/ irritation</li><li>Delivers serum directly to skin to help <strong>increase absorption & results</strong></li></ul>"
